Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.30,0:00:06.48,Main,,0,0,0,,O que será de mim de agora em diante?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.50,0:00:14.64,Main,,0,0,0,,Depois de um tempo, eu parei de pensar sobre isso.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.74,0:00:18.12,Main,,0,0,0,,Talvez eu esqueci
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.28,0:00:24.28,Main,,0,0,0,,de como pensar
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.50,0:00:30.98,Main,,0,0,0,,Nada mais muda
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.98,0:00:33.64,Main,,0,0,0,,Esse mundo que pertence apenas a mim
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.64,0:00:36.52,Main,,0,0,0,,todo dia apenas continua...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.74,0:00:40.36,Main,,0,0,0,,Mas eu não estou sozinha
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.50,0:00:43.20,Main,,0,0,0,,Isso não me incomoda.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.44,0:05:02.62,Main,,0,0,0,,Mesmo que todas essas memórias me deixem triste
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.72,0:05:05.36,Main,,0,0,0,,eu tenho que seguir em frente, acreditando no futuro.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.16,0:05:08.56,Main,,0,0,0,,Mesmo quando percebo minha solidão
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.10,0:05:10.96,Main,,0,0,0,,e estou perto de perder toda esperança
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.94,0:05:17.50,Main,,0,0,0,,essas memórias me tornam forte
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.88,0:05:20.78,Main,,0,0,0,,Eu não estou sozinha...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.02,0:05:23.06,Main,,0,0,0,,por causa de você
Dialogue: 3,0:05:40.20,0:05:42.18,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,150)}Obrigada.
