Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.52,0:01:33.36,Song eng,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}I could never find the right way to tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.02,0:01:37.06,Song eng,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Have you noticed I've been gone?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.16,0:01:43.38,Song eng,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Cause I left behind the home that you made me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.92,0:01:46.74,Song eng,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}But I will carry it along.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.20,0:01:52.00,Song eng,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}It's a long way forward, so trust in me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.60,0:01:56.52,Song eng,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}I'll give them shelter like you've done for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.04,0:02:03.24,Song eng,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}And I know, I'm not alone, you'll be watching over us.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.24,0:02:05.39,Song eng,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Until you're gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.18,0:02:50.42,Song eng,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}When I'm older I'll be silent beside you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.86,0:02:54.16,Song eng,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}I know words won't be enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.64,0:03:00.27,Song eng,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}And they won't need to know our names or our faces.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.56,0:03:03.74,Song eng,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}But they will carry on for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.12,0:03:08.86,Song eng,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}It's a long way forward, so trust in me.
